**Step 1:** N-alkylation of 5-amino-1H-1,2,4-triazole-3-carboxylic acid with benzyl bromide (containing the azetidine group) to form the N-benzylated triazole carboxylic acid.

**Step 2:** Amide coupling between the triazole carboxylic acid and 3-methoxyaniline to form the target molecule.

